# mm.fs tests

Exercises path normalisation and its limits, mount shapes and slots,
longest-prefix resolution, the rules mm.fs keeps itself (CrossVolume, the
mount point, Busy unmount, a failed flush), File and Directory moves and
destructors, the clock hook, NoSpace, McuStorage on an unserved platform, and
the conformance checks over an in-memory reference volume at "/" and under a
prefix.
